    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SIGILLUM is a first-person survival horror videogame inspired by the history and culture of the city of M\u00e1laga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/5eb07a6e9ae75dd5f9aa404fbfdbf9cc.poster.avif?t=1753475549\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/5eb07a6e9ae75dd5f9aa404fbfdbf9cc.webm?t=1753475549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/5eb07a6e9ae75dd5f9aa404fbfdbf9cc.mp4?t=1753475549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The streets have fallen into darkness, the disease has spread, and souls wander aimlessly. You must uncover the secrets hidden behind the sudden appearance of this new threat, eliminating or avoiding the enemies that will appear along the way, seeking alternative routes and solving puzzles that will allow you to continue with the divine mission, with the objetive of ending the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/682e252e805cc87f5a5aef20cc768d71.poster.avif?t=1753475549\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/682e252e805cc87f5a5aef20cc768d71.webm?t=1753475549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/682e252e805cc87f5a5aef20cc768d71.mp4?t=1753475549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Style Inspired by Classic Survival Horror</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic gameplay and artistic style is combined with polished animations to deliver a dynamic experience to the player.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Faithful Representation of the City</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the streets of M\u00e1laga, a city with a mysterious and sinister background, rendered with great attention to detail.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative Inspired by Reality</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SIGILLUM's narrative incorporates elements from real events that occurred hundreds of years ago.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tricked-out Camera</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your camera's flash to detect enemies and render them vulnerable to your attacks.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Hides in the Shadows</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are virtually imperceptible in the dark, so you'll need to rely on ambient lighting and your camera to detect danger.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SIGILLUM is a first-person survival horror videogame inspired by the history and culture of the city of M\u00e1laga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/5eb07a6e9ae75dd5f9aa404fbfdbf9cc.poster.avif?t=1753475549\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/5eb07a6e9ae75dd5f9aa404fbfdbf9cc.webm?t=1753475549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/5eb07a6e9ae75dd5f9aa404fbfdbf9cc.mp4?t=1753475549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The streets have fallen into darkness, the disease has spread, and souls wander aimlessly. You must uncover the secrets hidden behind the sudden appearance of this new threat, eliminating or avoiding the enemies that will appear along the way, seeking alternative routes and solving puzzles that will allow you to continue with the divine mission, with the objetive of ending the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/682e252e805cc87f5a5aef20cc768d71.poster.avif?t=1753475549\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/682e252e805cc87f5a5aef20cc768d71.webm?t=1753475549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565390/extras/682e252e805cc87f5a5aef20cc768d71.mp4?t=1753475549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Style Inspired by Classic Survival Horror</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic gameplay and artistic style is combined with polished animations to deliver a dynamic experience to the player.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Faithful Representation of the City</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the streets of M\u00e1laga, a city with a mysterious and sinister background, rendered with great attention to detail.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative Inspired by Reality</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SIGILLUM's narrative incorporates elements from real events that occurred hundreds of years ago.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tricked-out Camera</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your camera's flash to detect enemies and render them vulnerable to your attacks.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Hides in the Shadows</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are virtually imperceptible in the dark, so you'll need to rely on ambient lighting and your camera to detect danger.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The streets have fallen ill. You have been sent on a divine mission; you are the only hope to eradicate the evil that looms over the city and to uncover the secrets hidden in its depths.",
