    "content_descriptors": {
        "ids": [
            5
        ],
        "notes": "A first-person survival horror game that contains elements of violence and combat against hostile enemies. Players will use melee weapons such as daggers, hammers, and spears, as well as firearms, including pistols and shotguns, to defend themselves against the infected. Combat is primarily close-quarters, and enemies may release small amounts of blood when hit. The environment may feature scenes with corpses and visible bloodstains. When an enemy is defeated, their body will remain on the ground as part of the scene. Some in-game dialogue may include coarse language and mild profanity and Combat is a necessity for survival, not a glorification of harm. The religious theme is used as a narrative tool to enrich the context and atmosphere of the game. It is approached in a respectful and careful manner, with no intention to offend anyone, and is aligned with the cultural and historical setting of the city. The portrayal of religious elements is designed to be an integral part of the narrative, without promoting or criticizing any religious beliefs or practices."
